@startuml
title SC-ORD-008 — The same message is delivered twice
participant "Order\n(saga)" as O
participant "Inventory" as I
participant "Payment" as P
participant "Payment\nprovider" as PSP

O ->> P : ChargePayment
P -> PSP : charge
PSP --> P : captured
P ->> O : PaymentCaptured
note over O : one transaction: message recorded,\nsaga CONFIRMING_STOCK,\nConfirmReservation to send
O ->> I : ConfirmReservation
P ->> O : PaymentCaptured (same message again)
note over O : message already recorded:\nacknowledged, nothing done
O ->> P : ChargePayment (sent again, new identifier)
note over P : the payment of this order is CAPTURED:\nanswered from its status,\nthe provider is not called
P ->> O : PaymentCaptured
note over O : a new message, but the saga\nno longer expects it:\nrecorded, no effect
@enduml
